<h2>Installation Diagnosis</h2>
<p>If a problem comes up after installing, first check the state with the diagnosis command.</p>

<p>In a plugin environment, use the command below first.</p>
<pre><code><span class="c"># Checks the installation and configuration state and tells you about problems (the first step in troubleshooting)</span>
/oh-my-claudecode:omc-doctor</code></pre>

<p>If you separately use the CLI runtime path, the following diagnosis is also possible.</p>
<pre><code><span class="c"># Diagnose from the CLI runtime path</span>
omc doctor
<span class="c"># Diagnose by pointing directly at the plugin installation folder</span>
omc doctor --plugin-dir /path/to/oh-my-claudecode</code></pre>
